              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lewi 23.33-34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yerobowamu ategeka ko haba ibirori by'iminsi mikuru mu kwezi kwa munani ku munsi wa cumi n'itanu, ngo bise n'iby'i Buyuda, nuko arazamuka ajya ku gicaniro. N'i Beteli yabigenzaga atyo atambirira izo nyana yaremye. I Beteli ahashyira abatambyi baba mu ngoro yubatse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ku munsi wa cumi n'itanu w'ukwezi kwa munani, ari ko kwezi yatoranije ubwe, arazamuka ajya ku gicaniro yari yaremye i Beteli, aharemera ibirori by'Abisirayeli, ajya ku gicaniro ahosereza imibavu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
